                                </div>
                                <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-gray-200 flex items-center justify-between">
                                    <span class="text-xs font-medium text-gray-500"><i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot mr-1"></i> Main Innovation Hub</span>
